        <h1>R.D. College 3D Digital Twin</h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">
          A living 3D model of the R.D. College of Engineering campus that maps
          buildings down to individual floors and units. Each unit carries its
          own ULPIN, so a fourth-floor office gets the same clear, searchable
          identity the Ministry already gives to a plot of land.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
