  <section class="features" id="features">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>One digital twin, four working parts</h2>
      <p>Everything a survey team, an admin office and a resident need
        to locate, verify and manage a property in the same model.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-grid">
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon icon-map" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>3D Campus Mapping</h3>
        <p>Explore every block of R.D. College in an interactive 3D
          model, built to scale from real survey data.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon icon-layers" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>Vertical Property Mapping</h3>
        <p>See individual floors and units mapped separately, so a
          top-floor unit is as identifiable as the plot beneath it.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon icon-pin" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>ULPIN Generation</h3>
        <p>Generate a unique land parcel identifier for every unit,
          extending the Ministry's ULPIN system into vertical space.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon icon-doc" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>Digital Property Records</h3>
        <p>Keep ownership, area and floor details in one searchable
          record tied directly to its ULPIN.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about" id="about">
    <div class="about-inner">
      <div>
        <h2>Built for R.D. College, designed for scale</h2>
        <p>The system is piloted on the R.D. College of Engineering campus
          in Ghaziabad as a working case study for the Ministry of Rural
          Development, ahead of wider rollout to properties that today
          exist only as flat land records.</p>
